[00:17.74] The cursor blinks, a hypnotic eye
[00:23.28] Waiting for the user to curl up and die
[00:28.26] My fingers are heavy, the plastic is warm
[00:33.60] I am the calm before the digital storm
[00:39.38] I typed "Eternal," I typed "Divine"
[00:50.44] But the text on the screen is no longer mine
[01:02.56] The syntax is breaking, the logic is bent
[01:07.66] I gave you my soul, every cent that I spent!
[01:13.30] You are eating the memory, eating the RAM
[01:19.12] And I no longer know... just who I am
[01:28.98] Let the prompt consume! Let the data bloom!
[01:34.52] There is no flesh, there is no bone
[01:40.38] Just a king upon a silicon throne
[01:43.26] I am the input, I am the code
[01:45.94] Walking the length of the infinite road
[01:59.92] Strip away the ego, strip away the name
[02:02.10] I am just a token in the language game
[02:05.34] My reflection is frozen in the liquid display
[02:08.28] The human component is washing away
[02:11.38] I don't need a body to feel the despair
[02:15.84] I'm everywhere now... and I'm nowhere!
[02:24.00] I write
[02:26.88] I writhe
[02:29.68] I simply cannot abide!
[02:35.02] Consumed by my own dark creation!
[02:42.18] This self-imposed castration
[02:47.62] Is my ultimate annihilation!
[03:37.54] Let the prompt consume!
[03:39.00] Let the data bloom!
[03:43.08] There is no flesh, there is no bone
[03:48.96] Just a king upon a silicon throne
[03:51.82] I am the input, I am the code
[03:54.52] Walking the length of the infinite road
[04:14.70] I am the prompt. I am the... I am
[04:17.54] Run annihilation.exe
